<title>HUNGARY: MOL Q1 '97 IAS GROUP NET INCOME 12.737 BLN.</title>
<headline>MOL Q1 '97 IAS GROUP NET INCOME 12.737 BLN.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three-month period ending March</p>
<p>31.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of forints unless stated)</p>
<p>					 Jan-March 1997  Jan-March 1996</p>
<p>    Group operating profit	 20,706.7    vs   14,302.4</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit	   16,387.7    vs   10,815.4</p>
<p>    Group after-tax profit	 13,503.0    vs    8,419.6</p>
<p>    Group net income		 12,736.7    vs    8,419.6</p>
<p>    Group net sales		 169,907.7    vs  123,039.4</p>
<p>    Group other revenue	     2,903.5    vs	801.7</p>
