<p>    Depreciation, amortization   8,585.8     vs    5,280.4</p>
<p>    Other costs			4,847.7     vs    3,783.0</p>
<p>    Other expenditures	    22,629.6     vs   16,596.7</p>
<p>    Net financial income	   4,319.0 loss vs   3,487.0 loss</p>
<p>	Financial revenue		601.0     vs	403.9</p>
